From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ykai55 <ykai55@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 19:50:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Fix native renderer lifecycle and handles

Make resource handles process-unique until exhaustion, make acquire and
release transactional, restore page state during teardown, contain callback
failures, and reject Android engine rebuilds while a native host is active.

---
